o\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy NVIDIA Nemotron3-Nano 30B hybrid LLM with SGLang - MoE, Mamba2, and attention layers with BF16/FP8 precision options.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/NVIDIA/Nemotron3-Nano\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Nemotron3-Super\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy NVIDIA Nemotron3-Super with SGLang - 120B hybrid MoE model (12B active) with 1M context window optimized for multi-agent systems and tool use.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/NVIDIA/Nemotron3-Super\"}]},{\"group\":\"Ernie\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Ernie4.5\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Ernie4.5 with SGLang - community contribution guide for Baidu's Ernie 4.5 model deployment.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/Ernie/Ernie4.5\"},{\"title\":\"Ernie4.5-VL\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Ernie4.5-VL vision-language model with SGLang - community contribution guide for Baidu's multimodal model.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/Ernie/Ernie4.5-VL\"}]},{\"group\":\"StepFun\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Step-3.7-Flash (new)\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Step-3.7-Flash multimodal reasoning engine with SGLang.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/StepFun/Step-3.7-Flash\"},{\"title\":\"Step-3.5-Flash\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Step-3.5 reasoning engine with SGLang. \"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/StepFun/Step3.5\"},{\"title\":\"Step3-VL-10B\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Step3-VL-10B multimodal model with SGLang - compact 10B dense model with frontier-level vision understanding, complex reasoning, and tool calling capabilities.\"},\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/cookbook/autoregressive/StepFun/Step3-VL-10B\"}]},{\"group\":\"InclusionAI\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Ring-2.6-1T\",\"metatags\":{\"description\":\"Deploy Ring-2.6-1T with SGLang - a trillion-parameter InclusionAI reasoning 